{"id": "pr179239", "arm": "inject", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "exit": 0, "seconds": 144.0, "files": ["homeassistant/components/opengarage/cover.py", "homeassistant/components/cover/__init__.py"], "answered": true, "is_error": false, "subtype": "success", "session_id": "1a370778-b48d-4ed6-b7e8-2513f8ea00bb", "num_turns": 5, "cost_usd": 0.07492, "input_tokens": 107030, "output_tokens": 1192, "answer": {"files": [{"path": "homeassistant/components/opengarage/cover.py", "lines": "OpenGarageCover (no toggle handling; async_close_cover/async_open_cover lines 74-90, _update_attr 92-104)", "why": "The garage reports only open/closed with no position, so the base toggle falls back to the stale `_cover_is_last_toggle_direction_open` flag (False after a HA-initiated close). The toggle then picks `open` on an already-open door, and `async_open_cover` returns silently. The entity needs a toggle that closes when is_closed is False and opens when it is True, or it needs to report position 100 when open."}, {"path": "homeassistant/components/cover/__init__.py", "lines": "CoverEntity._get_toggle_function (~416-446), `_cover_is_last_toggle_direction_open` (213, 247-251)", "why": "The fallback relies on a last-direction flag that is only updated when opening/closing is reported, so it goes stale for covers that are known to be open but have no position. Fully open covers whose is_closed is False should always close."}]}, "tool_calls": 4, "verinoda_calls": 0, "graphify_calls": 0, "network": [], "first_tools": ["Read", "Grep", "Read", "StructuredOutput"], "assist": {"inject": 0, "coupled_notes": 0, "gate": 0, "nudge": 0, "locate_calls": 0, "coupled_calls": 0, "tool_search": 0}}
